{"resourceIdentifier":"4050","resourceName":"Jiangxi Zhenghe Livestock Manure Treatment Project","description":"Jiangxi Zhenghe Livestock Manure Treatment Project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located in Jiangxi, China, which is operated by Jiangxi Zhenghe Ecological Agriculture Co., Ltd. The proposed project is an animal manure management system, which utilize livestock wastes from nearby farms, to produce biogas and organic fertilizer through an anaerobic digestion process. \r\nThe raw material (i.e. livestock waste) from neighboring farms was collected and transported to each biogas plant by the principle of proximity. Continuously stirred tank reactor (CSTR) type anaerobic digesters are used to capture methane-rich biogas. Biogas is then utilized in cogeneration units for heat and electricity generation. The thermal energy is utilized only for heating anaerobic fermenters. The generated electricity is both used for internal electricity requirements and supplied to the Central China Power Grid (CCPG). The slurry produced by anaerobic fermentation is transported through pipe networks and utilized in nearby farmland to create an ecological recycling industry. The residue waste is used to produce solid organic fertilizer.\r\nBefore the implementation of the project, manure from livestock farms was treated by uncovered anaerobic lagoons without biogas recovery, and CCPG provided the same amount of electricity. This is also the baseline scenario for the project. The successful implementation of the project not only reduces greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions but also develops clean biomass energy. The project utilizes waste resources and achieves sustainable development of the agriculture industry.\r\nThe project activity will reduce GHG in the atmosphere through avoiding methane emissions from anaerobic treatment of manure. It is estimated to deliver totally   640,129  tCO2e emission reduction during the 7 years’ crediting period, at an average amount of  4,480,903  tCO2e per year.","location":{"latitude":28.427679,"longitude":115.697231},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-01-17","endExclusive":"2023-02-17","endInclusive":"2023-02-16"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4050"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangxi"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Jiangxi Zhenghe Ecological Agriculture Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Jiangxi Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"4050"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"351126"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AM0073"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"08/11/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/01/2022 - 31/12/2041"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=82986&IDKEY=miquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkfc114437694","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4050_25DEC2022.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-01-17T18:13:47.843Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=81943&IDKEY=d903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdfu112999397","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Jiangxi_Zhenghe_Listing_Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-01-03T09:28:51Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATI